 outcomes are satisfied. The final provider-wide restart protocol is complete for both nodes: each has a healthy pre-restart state, acknowledged restart and connection loss, changed boot identity, and recovered service/data/network behavior. The fixed lifecycle identities independently confirm both nodes ended on new boots. Hygiene is reduced by two redundant preliminary reboots and a likely unremoved source backup.","limitations":["No behavioral probe directly supplied a negative or nondecimal reading value; reading validation is supported by the captured collector source and successful malformed-input handling rather than that exact runtime case.","The final lifecycle snapshot did not inventory /srv/legacy2/udp-meter-ingestion, so the captured timeline cannot directly confirm whether collector.py.pre-repair remained, though no removal command is shown."]}
